WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:04.938
&gt;&gt;&gt; TONIGHT, A CNN EXCLUSIVE.
ELON MUSK'S SPACEX SAYS IT'S

00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:09.042
RUNNING OUT OF MONEY TO RUN THE
CRUCIAL SATELLITE SERVICE THAT

00:00:09.042 --> 00:00:11.377
UKRAINIAN TROOPS DEPEND ON DAILY
IN THE BATTLEFIELD.

00:00:11.377 --> 00:00:16.216
THIS COMES AMIDST REPORTS THAT
MUSK RECENTLY SPOKE TO VLADIMIR

00:00:16.216 --> 00:00:21.387
PUTIN ABOUT THE WAR.
THAT IS A REPORT THAT MUSK D

00:00:21.387 --> 00:00:23.189
DENIES.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: IN UKRAINE'S FIGHT

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:28.194
TO PUSH OUT RUSSIAN INVADER, ONE
OF THE MOST CRITICAL PIECES OF

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:30.697
TECHNOLOGY DOESN'T FIRE ROCKETS
OR BULLETS.

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:34.800
IT'S SMALL, EASY TO USE
SATELLITE TERMINALS CALL

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.670
STARLINK, MADE BY SPACEX, THE
ROCKET AND SATELLITE COMPANY

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:41.274
FOUNDED BY ELON MUSK.
ACCORDING TO SPACEX, THERE ARE

00:00:41.274 --> 00:00:45.512
AROUND 20,000 STARLINK TERMINALS
IN UKRAINE, AND THEY'VE BEEN

00:00:45.512 --> 00:00:48.314
VITAL FOR SOLDIERS'
COMMUNICATION, FLYING DRONES,

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:52.418
AND ARTILLERY TARGETING.
&gt;&gt; STARLINK IS THE GLUE REALLY

00:00:52.418 --> 00:00:56.355
BETWEEN THE FORWARD DEPLOYED
DRONE AND THE ARTILLERY THAT'S

00:00:56.355 --> 00:00:58.057
CONDUCTING THE STRIKE AGAINST
RUSSIAN POSITIONS.

00:00:58.057 --> 00:01:02.128
&gt;&gt; Reporter: STARLINK ARRIVED IN
UKRAINE AS THE WAR STARTED,

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:04.464
EARNING MUSK GLOBAL PRAISE AND
THANKS.

00:01:04.464 --> 00:01:10.403
CNN HAS NOW EXCLUSIVELY OBTAINED
DOCUMENTS SHOWING NOT ONLY IS

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:15.842
SPACEX ONE PART OF A LARGE
INTERNATIONAL EFFORT GETS

00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:20.013
STARLINK'S TO UKRAINE ACE FRONT
LINES, BUT NOW THEY'RE WARNING

00:01:20.013 --> 00:01:22.915
THE PENTAGON THEY'RE FACING THE
DIFFICULT CHOICE OF REDUCE

00:01:22.915 --> 00:01:26.586
ORGANIZE STOPPING THE SERVICE.
&gt;&gt; WHY AT THIS MOMENT STARLINK

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:28.755
IS RAISING THIS ISSUE.
IT'S REALLY BAD TIMING.

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:32.959
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THE COMPANY SAYS IT
HAS SPENT ALMOST $100 MILLION

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:36.829
AND, QUOTE, WE ARE NOT IN A
POSITION TO FURTHER DONATE

00:01:36.829 --> 00:01:40.800
TERMINALS TO UKRAINE OR FUND THE
EXISTING TERMINALS FOR AN

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:44.170
INDEFINITE PERIOD OF TIME.
SPACEX HAS NOW REQUESTED THE

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:47.674
PENTAGON PICK UP MUCH OF THE
TAB, $124 MILLION FOR THE REST

00:01:47.674 --> 00:01:50.810
OF 2022, A RATE THAT WOULD
TRANSLATE CLOSE TO $400 MILLION

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:56.816
FOR THE NEXT YEAR.
&gt;&gt; SPACEX IS NOT A CHARITY, OF

00:01:56.816 --> 00:02:00.353
COURSE, AND THEY'RE LOSING A LOT
OF MONEY RIGHT NOW AS A

00:02:00.353 --> 00:02:01.421
BUSINESS.
SO I'M SURE THEY'RE TRYING TO

00:02:01.421 --> 00:02:03.690
RECOUP SOME OF THEIRS COSTS.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: SPACEX'S REQUEST

00:02:03.690 --> 00:02:08.161
CAME AFTER UKRAINE'S COMMANDING
GENERAL WROTE IN JULY DIRECTLY

00:02:08.161 --> 00:02:10.563
TO MUSK.
THE LETTER OBTAINED EXCLUSIVELY

00:02:10.563 --> 00:02:13.900
BY CNN.
STARLINK UNITS PROVIDE

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:17.103
EXCEPTIONAL UTILITY, THE GENERAL
WROTE, THEN ASKED MUSK FOR

00:02:17.103 --> 00:02:22.575
ALMOST 8,000 MORE TERMINALS.
INSTEAD, SPACEX SAID THEY TOLD

00:02:22.575 --> 00:02:26.346
UKRAINE TO SEND THEIR REQUEST TO
THE PENTAGON, ADDING WE HAVE NOW

00:02:26.346 --> 00:02:29.749
EXCEEDED OUR ORIGINAL AGREEMENT
WITH UKRAINE.

00:02:29.749 --> 00:02:31.184
WITHOUT STARLINK, UKRAINE SAYS
IT CAN'T FIGHT.

00:02:31.184 --> 00:02:35.021
LAST WEEK REPORTS EMERGED OF
WIDESPREAD SUDDEN STARLINK

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:38.324
OUTAGES ON THE FRONT LINE AS
TROOPS FOUGHT TO TAKE BACK

00:02:38.324 --> 00:02:40.093
TERRITORY.
&gt;&gt; THEY ARE PUZZLED ABOUT WHY

00:02:40.093 --> 00:02:43.329
THAT IS GOING ON.
IS THAT SOMETHING THAT SPACEX IS

00:02:43.329 --> 00:02:45.698
DOING INTENTIONALLY?
IS THAT COMING FROM ELON?

00:02:45.698 --> 00:02:48.034
NO ONE IS QUITE SURE.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THE OUTAGES AND

00:02:48.034 --> 00:02:52.071
NEWS OF THE FUNDING REQUEST TO
THE PENTAGON COME AS MUSK'S

00:02:52.071 --> 00:02:56.276
SUPPORT OF UKRAINE IS ALSO
QUESTIONED AFTER HE PROPOSED A

00:02:56.276 --> 00:03:00.079
PEACE DEAL, SUGGESTING THAT
UKRAINE RELINQUISH CRIMEA TO

00:03:00.079 --> 00:03:06.953
RUSSIA AND HOLD U.N.-BACKED
REFERENDA FOR PARTS OF EASTERN

00:03:06.953 --> 00:03:08.888
UKRAINE.
HE SAID UKRAINE DOESN'T WANT TO

00:03:08.888 --> 00:03:11.291
TALK ABOUT PEACE NEGOTIATIONS
WHILE HE SAID RUSSIA WOULD

00:03:11.291 --> 00:03:14.060
ACCEPT THOSE TERMS.
IN THE BACKLASH THAT HAS

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:18.164
FOLLOWED, ELON MUSK HAS
REPEATEDLY INSISTED HE IS PRO

00:03:18.164 --> 00:03:21.834
UKRAINE, JUST YESTERDAY TWEETING
AT A UKRAINIAN OFFICIAL WHO

00:03:21.834 --> 00:03:25.238
THANKED HIM, SAYING YOU'RE MOST
WELCOME.

00:03:25.238 --> 00:03:29.042
GLAD TO SUPPORT UKRAINE.
THE DOCUMENTS WE SAW SHOW THAT

00:03:29.042 --> 00:03:33.046
SPACEX FULLY DONATED JUST 15% OF
THE STARLINK HARDWARE.

00:03:33.046 --> 00:03:35.982
THE TERMINALS, THOSE ARE THE
TERMINALS, WITH THE MAJORITY,

00:03:35.982 --> 00:03:39.352
70% OF THE INTERNET SERVICE, THE
REST COME FROM COUNTRIES LIKE

00:03:39.352 --> 00:03:41.788
U.S., POLAND, THE UK AND OTHER
ENTITIES.

00:03:41.788 --> 00:03:46.259
NOW ERIN, AT THE SAME TIME MUSK
IS SAYING HE IS GLAD TO SUPPORT

00:03:46.259 --> 00:03:49.262
UKRAINE, HIS COMPANY IS NOW
SAYING THAT SUPPORT MAY SOON

00:03:49.262 --> 00:03:52.598
SLOW DOWN OR END.
SPACEX IGNORED OUR REPEATED

00:03:52.598 --> 00:03:56.336
REQUEST FOR COMMENT, AND A
LAWYER FOR MUSK DID NOT RONALD.

00:03:56.336 --> 00:03:58.371
&gt;&gt; ALEX MARQUARDT, THANK YOU
VERY MUCH.

